  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cook Fund for accelerated market roll-out of clean cooking solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim is to promote clean cooking sector development, supporting innovation and, production and to help actors unlock capital flows across technologies and their value chains. The action will support new investment in new models of the distribution as well as business development support services and sector specific skills development, though establishment of a clean CookFund managed by a Fund Manager.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
